# Core Services And Data

## Interfaces and implementations

- Match local pattern: `interfaces/` + `implementations/` (services) or `implementation/` (repositories).
- Names: `i_<name>.dart`, `I<Name>Service`, `I<Name>Repository`.
- Register with `@LazySingleton(as: I*)` or `@injectable` per nearby code.
- Blocs: `@injectable`, sealed events, `@CopyWith()` + Equatable states (not Freezed).

## Results and errors

- Preserve `Either<Exception, T>` and existing error types (e.g. `AuthException`).
- Do not expose internal service details to UI.
- Avoid public interface changes unless required and confirmed.

## Models

- DTOs, DB models, API models, enums, mappers in `packages/models`.
- Use existing mappers; regenerate Freezed/JSON via Melos.
